    "image_with_text_jFC67D": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_mckbY9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why Votives Are a Must-Have for Every Space",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_i6tgzQ": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It's not only the brightness of the candlelight that matters, but also the feelings it evokes. That’s why <strong>votive candles</strong> are an essential detail in any well-designed space. Their soft, low-profile glow helps create a mood that’s both calming and inviting, making them a favorite for everything from formal dinners to cozy home corners.</p><p>Unlike taller candles that demand visual attention, <strong>votives</strong> blend into your décor while still delivering visual warmth. Their compact size also makes them easy to reposition, replace, or group in multiples for a fuller effect.</p><p>Use <strong>votive candles</strong> to line tables, highlight decorative elements, or create clusters that feel intimate without feeling cluttered. Their flexibility makes them one of the most effective and affordable ways to transform your environment with light.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_mckbY9",
        "border_i6tgzQ",
        "text_hUYJ6B"
      ],
