    "image_with_text_pqUpUt": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_RkqJBW": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Small Votive Candles with Big Ambiance",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_JXVyTa": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_4bYC6X": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Don't let the size fool you, our <strong>small votive candles</strong> pack a punch when it comes to creating atmosphere. Their compact form allows them to fit into tight setups, while their steady flame adds just the right amount of glow to elevate the space.</p><p>Ideal for glass holders, votive jars, or minimalist trays, these <strong>small votive candles</strong> are made to adapt. They work beautifully in event setups that require clean lines, subtle light, and hassle-free maintenance. No dripping. No strong scent. Just dependable ambiance from start to finish.</p><p>For planners, designers, or everyday hosts, <strong>small votives</strong> are the go-to solution when you need impact without taking up space.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
