    "image_with_text_zyWPJC": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_cBEYdq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why Our Votive Candles Outshine the Rest",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_GCzVat": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_cETpbn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Quality matters—especially when your event or setting depends on it. At Kisco Candles, our <strong>votive candles</strong> are crafted for performance and consistency. Each candle is poured using high-grade wax and clean-burning wicks to ensure a flame that’s reliable and long-lasting.</p><p>Our<strong> votive candles</strong> are free from fragrance and mess, making them ideal for sensitive environments and high-traffic use. With options like 6-hour and 24-hour burn times, you can count on our votives to stay lit through dinners, ceremonies, or extended evening functions.</p><p>Customers choose Kisco because they know what to expect: clean design, no fuss, and candles that simply perform. Whether you’re lighting one or lining up a hundred, our <strong>votives</strong> are built to deliver from first light to final flicker.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
